 a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404761},{"name":"DaddyBearSEA/lab5a","owner":"DaddyBearSEA","html_url":"https://github.com/DaddyBearSEA/lab5a","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Lab5A to learn git hub commands and process while changing code and writing functions","topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404762},{"name":"hmorzaria/sdmcourse","owner":"hmorzaria","html_url":"https://github.com/hmorzaria/sdmcourse","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"SDM course World Fishery Congress","topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404763},{"name":"noey2020/How-to-Talk-Screening-Stocks","owner":"noey2020","html_url":"https://github.com/noey2020/How-to-Talk-Screening-Stocks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404764},{"name":"burcu-erkan/hover-time","owner":"burcu-erkan","html_url":"https://github.com/burcu-erkan/hover-time","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Created with CodeSandbox","topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404765},{"name":"joviegas/test-aws-sdk-v1","owner":"joviegas","html_url":"https://github.com/joviegas/test-aws-sdk-v1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404766},{"name":"MatthewStoneMBA/Lander-Leash-Analytics-Project","owner":"MatthewStoneMBA","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthewStoneMBA/Lander-Leash-Analytics-Project","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180074,"global_rank":404767},{"name":"ingydotnet/tpf-grant-proposals","owner":"ingydotnet","html_url":"https://github.com/ingydotnet/tpf-grant-proposals","stars":0,"forks":0,"